  "description": "Core library of NewLife framework. Provides high-performance infrastructure for building scalable applications: logging (file/network), configuration (XML/JSON/HTTP), cache (memory/distributed), network (TCP/UDP/HTTP/WebSocket), serialization (binary/XML/JSON), APM tracing, IoC container, actor model, timer scheduler, plugin framework, and more. Supports .NET Framework 4.5 to .NET 10. 核心组件库，为构建可扩展应用程序提供高性能基础设施。提供日志（文件/网络）、配置（XML/JSON/HTTP）、缓存（内存/分布式）、网络（TCP/UDP/HTTP/WebSocket）、序列化（Binary/XML/JSON）、APM性能追踪、对象容器、并行模型、定时调度、插件框架等。支持.NET Framework 4.5至.NET 10全版本。",
